# Names only, per CLAUDE.md — never put a real value in this file.
#
# PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY is safe to be public (ARCHITECTURE.md "Security
# baseline": a Web3Forms access key is a client-side key by design, not a
# secret — it ships in the built bundle regardless). It's still kept out
# of git via .env so the source doesn't hardcode one specific account's
# key, and local dev works without editing code.
PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
